        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A prime multi-unit residential investment opportunity.\r\nComprising 1 x 1 bedroom and 1 x 2 apartment, set within a secure and established development.\r\nRanging in size from approximately 49 sq. m - 64 sq. m (527 sq. ft - 688 sq. ft).\r\nLocated on Kilgobbin Road within close proximity to the M50 Motorway.\r\nWell sought after residential location approximately 3km south of Sandyford & 12km south of Dublin city centre. \r\nWithin a short distance of multiple Dublin Bus routes and Glencairn LUAS stop.\r\nTotal current rent reserved 18,600 per annum.\r\nVacant possession of Apartment 3.\r\n\r\nThe property comprises a portfolio of 2 x apartments set within the well sought after gated community of Old Castle View in Stepaside, Dublin 18. The property is arranged to provide 1 x 1-bedroom apartment and 1 x 2 bedroom apartment. Stepaside is a village in south Dublin situated approximately 12km south of Dublin City Centre.\r\nThe subject property is located on Kilgobbin Road and within a minute's walk of Ballyogan Road.\r\nLocal amenities include UCD, Dundrum Town centre, The Beacon Hospital, multiple Golf courses and a wide range of shops, bars and restaurants.\r\nTransport links include bus routes (75, 46A, 7D, 84X & 145), The Gallops & Glencairn LUAS stops the N11 and M50.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease refer to legal documents"
